     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello and happy last day of May to all you R worshipers and phobes alike!<div><br></div><div>Tomorrow will be our final work group of the quarter, so swing by the data lab classroom (360 Shields Library) or <a href=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/92807937862\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/92807937862&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465085686000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3OBueqsZ6KnXuj6wM13Xdx\">zoom</a> with any R questions, discussion, and quips. As usual, we would appreciate if zoomers could post questions to the <a href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465085686000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2DA63K1ZR1IJ9h4C2AeB7d\">Discourse</a> site before joining.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Your D-RUG Coo[R]dinators<br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Christian John — Ph.D. candidate</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">NASA FINESST Future Investigator</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Pronouns: he/him/his</span><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><div><a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&amp;user=VPd60tMAAAAJ&amp;view_op=list_works&amp;authuser=1&amp;sortby=pubdate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://scholar.goog